51378,"key":"gAHy6geY2i","overlayLabel":"35","title":"Chapter 35","availableFrom":null,"ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/2rh4fE1zNK-bKw_Rner2Ivzy6JzmL10VgEwinOtR7QI"},"tracks":[{"channels":"mono","duration":325,"fileSize":5251378,"format":"aac","key":"y8xaMHSyjs","overlayLabel":"35","title":"Chapter 35","type":"audio","ambient":null,"display":{"icon16x16":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/2rh4fE1zNK-bKw_Rner2Ivzy6JzmL10VgEwinOtR7QI"}}]}]},"metadata":{"category":"stories","description":"Enter a world of wonder with this heartfelt Christmas classic from bestselling children's author Ben Miller.  Jackson knows all about the flying reindeer, he knows about the elves and the secret North Pole workshop, he knows about the magic that allows Father Christmas to deliver presents around the world in just one night, but there's one thing he doesn't know . . . how did Father Christmas become Father Christmas?  That all changes when, one Christmas Eve, Jackson meets Father Christmas and hears his incredible story.      So begins an enchanting fairy-tale into a magical snowy landscape, where Torvil, a mean-spirited and miserly elf, is about to discover the true meaning of Christmas. This might not have been the story Jackson was expecting but, as Father Christmas tells him, no good story ever is... ","maxAge":12,"minAge":8,"abridged":false,"author":"Ben Miller","accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Ben Miller"],"copyrights":["©2018 Ben Miller. All rights reserved. ℗2018 Simon & Schuster, UK. All Rights Reserved. Cover illustration by Elisa Paganelli."],"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/gicCOwZoFPWO_AsXc6586EFAqvDujphBD5GXJqdzAUo"},"languages":["en-gb"],"media":{"duration":11479,"fileSize":185630473},"narrators":["Ben Miller"]},"slug":"the-night-i-met-father-christmas","title":"The Night I Met Father Christmas","userId":"yoto","sortkey":"the-night-i-met-father-christmas","clubAvailability":[],"cardId":"5U